{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15790","headline":"御制雨後出城观览敕朝臣已下属和 · 司空曙","name":"御制雨後出城观览敕朝臣已下属和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上上开鹑野，师师出凤城。\n因知圣主念，得遂老农情。\n陇麦垂秋合，郊尘得雨清。\n时新荐玄祖，岁足富苍生。\n却马川原静，闻鸡水土平。\n薰弦歌舜德，和鼎致尧名。\n览物欣多稼，垂衣御大明。\n史官何所录，称瑞满天京。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15790.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15790","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}